# === Sprint 1 de-bloat (2026-06-12): regenerable pipeline outputs — local only ===
# All solve outputs, generated case reports, dashboards, and decks are reproducible
# from tracked source + data/ + scenarios/. Kept on disk, dropped from git tracking.
artifacts/
reports/*.html
reports/*.html.txt
reports/decks/
scenarios/generated/
# Keep golden references and Markdown deliverables tracked:
!examples/
# Keep repo-trim sprint execution reports tracked (deliverables tied to commits).
# Scoped to the 2026-06-12 trim work so unrelated *-sprint-* report names (e.g. the
# 2026-05-19 validation-sprint phase reports) stay untracked/regenerable.
!reports/2026-06-12-sprint-*.html
!reports/2026-06-12-final-sprint-*.html

# === Sprint 1 PHASE-03: untrack foreign tooling + local-only deck output ===
# present/ decks are regenerated by scripts/python/integration/generate_samsung_ttc_deck.py
present/
# OpenCode assistant skill bundle (user tooling; keep on disk, like .claude/)
.opencode/
.opencode_http.log
